  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "传媒学院的同学到齐了  (Media College Classmates Have Arrived)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Star Night arrives at last! As host Wen Simo warms up the broadcast, Bu Xiaogu welcomes her Media College classmates to the red carpet and Qin Xiao reports to her director. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "众星闪耀的红毯仪式即将开始。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现场已经聚集了国内的各家媒体以及热情的观众朋友们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "您最期待的明星是哪位？接下来我们拭目以待。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "同学们都到齐了，今天真是多亏大家帮忙！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一会儿让同学们尽量往前站，就站这两排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "请大家高声呼喊，帮我们把现场情绪调动起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们传媒学院助阵的同学全都到位了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，同学们这边请，辛苦大家了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，现场的观众已经全到齐了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "辛惠美的车果然也到了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "众星闪耀的红毯仪式即将开始。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The star-studded red-carpet ceremony is about to begin.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现场已经聚集了国内的各家媒体以及热情的观众朋友们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Domestic media outlets and enthusiastic audience friends have gathered on site.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "您最期待的明星是哪位？接下来我们拭目以待。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which star do you look forward to most? Let us wait and see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "同学们都到齐了，今天真是多亏大家帮忙！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone from school is here; thank you all so much for helping today!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一会儿让同学们尽量往前站，就站这两排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In a moment have our classmates stand near the front along these two rows.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "请大家高声呼喊，帮我们把现场情绪调动起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please cheer loudly to help us lift the energy on set.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们传媒学院助阵的同学全都到位了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All the Media College students cheering for us are in position.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，同学们这边请，辛苦大家了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, right this way classmates; thank you for your hard work!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，现场的观众已经全到齐了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director, the audience on site has all arrived.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "辛惠美的车果然也到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sure enough, Xin Huimei's car has arrived too.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "众星闪耀的红毯仪式即将开始。",
      "gap": 0.5
